<ptxt>Inspect Back Door Lock Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Push the latch of the back door lock assembly with a flat-tipped screwdriver or equivalent to put it in the locked (full latch) state.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B154882J01" width="2.775699831in" height="4.7836529in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Inspect the door lock operation when battery voltage is applied to each terminal of the connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
</spec>
